#### the_table_of_contents_links_every_heading (test)

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n\ntable_of_contents (Cons (post.Heading \"A\", Cons (post.Paragraph \"x\", Cons (post.Heading \"B\", Nil))))\n|> _assert_eq (\n       \"<nav class=\\\"toc\\\"><p>On this page</p><ol><li><a href=\\\"#section-1\\\">A</a></li><li><a \"\n       ^^ \"href=\\\"#section-2\\\">B</a></li></ol></nav>\"\n   )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test

  table_of_contents (Cons (post.Heading "A", Cons (post.Paragraph "x", Cons (post.Heading "B", Nil))))
  |> _assert_eq (
         "<nav class=\"toc\"><p>On this page</p><ol><li><a href=\"#section-1\">A</a></li><li><a "
         ^^ "href=\"#section-2\">B</a></li></ol></nav>"
     )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

